{"id":"91065cedbdf2fc27","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-low-high.md","title":"任意 oracle 的 Low/High 谓词与 Δ₂ 度层级","display":"df-low-high — 任意 oracle 的 Low/High 谓词与 Δ₂ 度层级","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-low-high","aliases":["20-df-low-high"],"display":"df-low-high — 任意 oracle 的 Low/High 谓词与 Δ₂ 度层级","chapter":"4","section":"4.4.2；9.5","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Definition 4.4.3；Theorem 4.5.6；Theorem 9.5.1 的适用范围","source_printed_pages":[92,97,179],"source_pdf_pages":[128,133,211],"depends_on":["[[20-df-jump]]","[[20-df-degle]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-low-high"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-low-high</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-low-high — 任意 oracle 的 Low/High 谓词与 Δ₂ 度层级"},{"key":"chapter","html":"4"},{"key":"section","html":"4.4.2；9.5"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 4.4.3；Theorem 4.5.6；Theorem 9.5.1 的适用范围"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92</span><span>97</span><span>179</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>128</span><span>133</span><span>211</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e888141c21b61ce5\" href=\"?note=e888141c21b61ce5\" title=\"20-df-degle\">20-df-degle</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_2=\\{\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal D:\\mathbf a\\le\\mathbf0\\prime\\}\">\\(D_2=\\{\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal D:\\mathbf a\\le\\mathbf0\\prime\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e888141c21b61ce5\" href=\"?note=e888141c21b61ce5\" title=\"20-df-degle\">20-df-degle</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}low-high}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Low}_n(A)\\Longleftrightarrow A^{(n)}\\equiv_T\\varnothing^{(n)},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{High}_n(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\varnothing^{(n+1)}\\le_T A^{(n)},\\\\\nL_n:=\\{\\mathbf a\\in D_2:\\mathbf a^{(n)}=\\mathbf0^{(n)}\\},\\quad\nH_n:=\\{\\mathbf a\\in D_2:\\mathbf a^{(n)}=\\mathbf0^{(n+1)}\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}low-high}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Low}_n(A)\\Longleftrightarrow A^{(n)}\\equiv_T\\varnothing^{(n)},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{High}_n(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\varnothing^{(n+1)}\\le_T A^{(n)},\\\\\nL_n:=\\{\\mathbf a\\in D_2:\\mathbf a^{(n)}=\\mathbf0^{(n)}\\},\\quad\nH_n:=\\{\\mathbf a\\in D_2:\\mathbf a^{(n)}=\\mathbf0^{(n+1)}\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Low}_n(X)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Low}_n(\\operatorname{set}(X)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{High}_n(X)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{High}_n(\\operatorname{set}(X))\n\\quad(X\\in2^\\omega,\\ n\\in\\omega).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Low}_n(X)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Low}_n(\\operatorname{set}(X)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{High}_n(X)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{High}_n(\\operatorname{set}(X))\n\\quad(X\\in2^\\omega,\\ n\\in\\omega).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Low 谓词适用于任意集合；特别是 low₂ 只要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\prime\\prime\\equiv_T0\\prime\\prime\">\\(A\\prime\\prime\\equiv_T0\\prime\\prime\\)</span>，不预先要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\le_T0\\prime\">\\(A\\le_T0\\prime\\)</span>。原书第 4 章的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_n,H_n\">\\(L_n,H_n\\)</span> 仍限定于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_2\">\\(D_2\\)</span>，所以书中图示和层级包含关系保持原范围。一般 High 谓词采用跳跃下界；若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\le_T0\\prime\">\\(A\\le_T0\\prime\\)</span>，上界自动成立，它与原书的相等定义一致。第 9.5 节的 HIF–low₂ 路径可能不在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_2\">\\(D_2\\)</span> 内；旧 Hypothesis 会错误排除这些路径。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 4.4.3；Theorem 4.5.6；Theorem 9.5.1 的适用范围；印刷页 92, 97, 179；PDF 第 128, 133, 211 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"e890b3c29e4a70a3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-degle","status":"resolved","id":"e888141c21b61ce5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-degle]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"e890b3c29e4a70a3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnch